src/DEPG0213BN.py

MicroPython driver for the DEPG0213BN e-paper panel fitted to the LILYGO TTGO
T5, carried unmodified. MIT licensed.

    https://github.com/Inqbus/micropython_DEPG0213BN

The copy distributed here has no licence header of its own; the terms come from
the upstream repository. Its own source comment credits the waveform tables to
lewisxhe's GxEPD port.

